{"title":"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Practice Relay Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Practice_Relay_Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Replace <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> below with the number you receive.\n</p><p>Kiran is thinking about his age. He determines that six years from today, he will be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c6878713578626763c38433b3f4c8c2205ad0c15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> years old. How old will Kiran be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> years from today?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Practice_Relay_Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Because he will be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c6878713578626763c38433b3f4c8c2205ad0c15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> years, Kian must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/f/92fbb402610a7a4e067ee500614a8abfeb5895bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11 - 6 = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"85\" height=\"15\" /> years old currently.\n</p><p>Thus, in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> years, he will be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/8/e88e266a5f58dab21d5ff86cf3e633d3809e9104.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N + 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"50\" height=\"16\" /> years old.\n</p><p>From <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Practice_Relay_Problem_3\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Practice Relay Problem 3\">player 3</a>, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/b/aabc5a91c3d16d5587ae413b3ff554cb9486695c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N = 70$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"61\" height=\"14\" />. This means that in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> years, he will be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/7/b07a3a5ea8afedad3203b7231e89ff76d8cc5956.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$70 + 5 = \\boxed{75}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"105\" height=\"25\" /> years old.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC\">2024 CEMC TUC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Practice_Relay_Problem_3\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Practice Relay Problem 3\">Practice Relay Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_A_Problem_1\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Relay A Problem 1\">Relay A Problem 1</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 7 (page does not exist)\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 8 (page does not exist)\">8</a>